	(text "Buttons are active low. The XVF3800 GPO pins are assumed active high (LED on when high). Status LED: red/green from XVF pins 56/58 as on XMOS's two-\ncolour LED; blue anode left open. The mute LED is driven by the ESP32.\nXVF3800 flash: QSPI_CS_N pull-up 4.7k. Must be ready within 300 us of reset release. The four flash lines are also reachable by the ESP32 through the\nswitches on sheet esp32_io. No SPI-slave boot."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.54 131.556 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "54e4c59f-e077-51a0-9fc8-cbbfb3afda32")
	)
